    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you for accepting my plea, Damazti.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is not a difficult wish to grant.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Coincidentally, we just freed ourselves from some nastier things.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A classroom. You ended up inviting us here in the end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A rational and reasonable decision, Golding. You always said you saw yourself as a teacher, after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think, I shall die here today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're set on this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lettou will be sad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to do it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are you so hung up on this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right, why am I?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't let go of the children, I worry that they can't find a place to belong in our current world. I can't let go of Molly either, she's a good girl, but she doesn't know how to protect herself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And of course, there's Heidi... but I've let her down. I only hope she won't resent me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Probably a difficult thing to do, seeing as I've caused the deaths of so many.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I deserve any resentment coming my way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Golding, you know dying like this won't change anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Honestly, we're confused by your decision...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "In our long-lived experience, it isn't rare to see one embrace death, but we're still puzzled by it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We are well familiar with the words, 'sacrifice,' 'repellence,' 'guilt,' and perhaps even more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The final outcome always leads to death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, but this is such a futile act to us. Death holds little meaning and isn't worth such obsession.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Death is just death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know what you mean, Damazti. I understand what you're saying.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I wished to make amends for the fallen Self-Salvation Corps fighters, perhaps the better choice would've been to live on, to care for the families left behind, to heal the suffering in their stead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, I know... I can't do that, I can't possibly face all that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm so scared.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is facing death easier than facing your fears?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've always run away from things... I thought I could keep living as long as I avoided getting caught by the tide.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But when does one finally stop running and admit that one's life has fallen apart?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "When does one admit that one's old life never existed in the first place?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't bring myself to face all of this, so I'd rather choose to die before I completely succumb to my despair.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me lie to myself just this once, Damazti.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
