    },
    {
        "text": "You've taken my form.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't get the wrong idea, Golding. We don't actually like our job that much. We won't deceive those precious to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Golding'"
    },
    {
        "text": "We just... want to better understand your feelings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Golding'"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a difficult emotion to understand, so we can only try to feel it firsthand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Golding'"
    },
    {
        "text": "You asked me before how to live a life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "How am I even supposed to come up with an answer?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then again, now that I've realized my own powerlessness, choosing to give up could also count as a choice, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Give up,' Lettou also said this before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Golding'"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, it's not about giving up on yourself and letting life wash over you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's to give up on the act of living.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "Give up on living, you say.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Golding'"
    },
    {
        "text": "All these experiences...whether they hold joy or pain, there isn't really a need to hold onto them so tightly, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "In fact, you feel as though you're in the middle of a labyrinth, you realize the walls are in fact made of said experiences.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wouldn't even call this a struggle, it truly is the coward's choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "But at least... I won't stand by their side again, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm... just so tired of it all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Golding'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Goodnight, Golding.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Golding'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
