        "key": "$loneliness_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm at my limit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I really am... so tired.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, at the very least, the Glasgow Gang managed to reunite while I'm still here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope they can all get away safely.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Baird staggers to a wall, and slowly sits herself down, drawing a long bloodstain behind her."
    },
    {
        "text": "Her hand is already going numb. She tries to make a fist, but to no avail."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh... death sure hurts a lot more than I had imagined. Hurts more than when Hannah socked me in the jaw.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "She turns her head and spots a corpse not far from her. Lean and emaciated, he seems to have died a few days ago."
    },
    {
        "text": "It suddenly occurs to her how familiar the corpse's face is."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So this is where you ended up, Mr. 'Next Academician.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "A can of meat lay close to the timid citizen, its contents completely cleaned out without even a little bit remaining."
    },
    {
        "text": "Baird blinks a few times at something strange by the poor man's side. From the wall to the floor is... a bunch of black curvy lines?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Words and diagrams."
    },
    {
        "text": "Only now does Baird realize that he had picked up another pen to write with\u2014 a battered charcoal pencil, a tool far less respectable than his precious fountain pen."
    },
    {
        "text": "She touches her own pocket. The fine fountain pen that had belonged to him is still with her. It's a shame McClaren never read the final words written by this gorgeous pen."
    },
    {
        "text": "She manages to drag her body with some difficulty towards the writing on the wall, and carefully makes out the tiny handwriting."
    },
    {
        "text": "She laughs, and also starts coughing."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A thesis on heraldry as an application to be a Fellow of the Royal Victorian Academy of Sciences?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mister, you chose to write <i>this</i> of all the other things you could have written?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's totally useless.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Baird skips over the long, stupefying paragraphs of research and references."
    },
    {
        "text": "The paper ends abruptly. After a blank page is an angry note from the man on how he had forgotten some important material he wanted to add."
    },
    {
        "text": "His desperation shows through the broken writing that eventually fades off the page."
    },
    {
        "text": "At some point, he seems to have begun writing his wishes instead."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'I hope 'The Genealogy of the Ashworth Family' can manifest in my hands soon.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'I hope the editors will understand how significant my work is, and increase my book advance.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 26,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'I hope the professor won't be angry at me, those were just academic arguments and I still respect him very much.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'Fine, if I get the chance, I'm willing to concede the debate, and share some of his tea again.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'I'm still so hungry, I could really go for the fried fins sold on the street corner.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'I hope Jane hasn't forgotten me, I love her just as much as when I left her.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'I'm a scoundrel. I hope those kids at the gym are doing alright.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'I want to drink three million barrels of whiskey.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "......",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'Aunt Sarah, I miss you, I'm sorry to have grown up into such a bad child.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'Bloody hell.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'Bloody hell, who would even grant my wishes? I've prayed as hard as I can to all the beings I know and don't.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'If that evangelistic Liberi Cleric showed up right in front of me, I'd give him a thrashing for sure.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'Alright, fine.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'I hope that everyone's wishes comes true, that everyone can be happy, safe, and healthy, to live their best lives, every single one.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'I hope no one will suffer anymore, or be tortured, everyone should be smiling, and all tears should evaporate off this great land, along with hunger.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'I hope that all of this wasn't in vain.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'I hope that all of this\u2014'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
